cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "verify-before-stop: A Claude Code Stop hook for blocking 'lies of completion'"
authors:
  - given-names: Ian
    family-names: Mu
    email: ian.y.mu@gmail.com
date-released: 2026-05-20
version: "1.0.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ianymu/claude-verify-before-stop"
url: "https://landing-ianymu.vercel.app"
abstract: >
  A bash-based Stop hook for Claude Code that blocks session-end events
  when source files have changed but no verification action has been
  logged within a configurable time window. Catches "lies of completion"
  — the common failure mode where the model claims work is done without
  having actually verified.
keywords:
  - claude-code
  - anthropic
  - llm-hooks
  - workflow-guard
  - ai-coding
  - productivity
